stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: agent requests a sensitive action
    Pending --> Approved: the owner replies 'confirm'
    Pending --> Denied: the owner replies anything else
    Pending --> Denied: timeout (5 minutes by default)
    Approved --> Executed: it acts
    Denied --> Told: says verbatim 'you said not to, so I didn't'
    Executed --> [*]
    Told --> [*]
    note right of Pending
        no ask, no action
        never silently perform an irreversible action
    end note
